<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14783" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">drăcuncŭlus</span></b> ,
		i, m.
		dim.
		draco. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A small serpent</i>, <i>dragonet</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Lampr. Alex. Sev. 14</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Jul.
					Val. Rer. Gest. Alex. 1, 5</span></i>.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A thread twisted like a serpent</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell.
			1572</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A sort of fish</i>, <i>dragonet</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				32, 11, 53, § 148</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>The plant tarragon</i>, Artemisia dracunculus,
			Linn.; <i><span class="en">Plin. 24, 16, 91, §
		142</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
